; nl-neutral-dictionary-query-band.fk — symbol, surface, description,
; Form recipe, and word/token relations, queryable both ways.
;
; Verdict 8191:
;   1      en "nothing" is symbol 0
;   2      en "nothing" and id "kosong" are the same symbol
;   4      es "nada" is the same symbol; sw "hakuna" is a homonym (two symbols)
;   8      symbol 0 has a description
;   16     "and" carries the Form recipe and
;   32     that recipe runs: (and 1 1) -> 1
;   64     Form symbol "+" runs as add
;   128    English "nothing" is 7 character tokens
;   256    token "n" belongs to more than one core word
;   512    admit "vitality" grows the dictionary; the old seed stays
;   1024   an unknown tongue answers nothing, not an error
;   2048   "+" is kind symbol, not a word
;   4096   overlay word "trust" is queryable
;
